1134	We argue the following bound:
1135	\begin{align}
1136	  \E_{(\line, \line_X, \line_Z) \sim D} \E_{(x,z,\alpha, \beta) \in \line} &\sum_{f_X, f_Z} \bra{\hat{\psi}} T^{\line_X, \line_Z}_{f_X, f_Z} \ot (I - \hat{Q}^{x, z }_{f_X(x),f_Z(z)}) \ket{\hat{\psi}}  \,=\, O\big( m \cdot (\eps^{1/4} + \delta_P^{1/4} + \delta_Q^{1/4} + \delta_{\Line}^{1/2})\big)\;. \label{eq:qld-combined-lines-consistency}
